==== hyperbricks yaml {!{page}} ====
page:
  - type: hypermedia
  - route: ordered-children

  - zeta:
      - type: html
      - value: <p>Renders first by source order.</p>

  - alpha:
      - type: html
      - value: <p>Renders second, not first alphabetically.</p>

  - middle:
      - type: html
      - value: <p>Renders third.</p>
==== explainer ====
Source order replaces numeric child keys; zeta renders before alpha because the YAML sequence says so.
==== expected json ====
{
  "@order": [
    "zeta",
    "alpha",
    "middle"
  ],
  "@type": "<HYPERMEDIA>",
  "alpha": {
    "@type": "<HTML>",
    "value": "<p>Renders second, not first alphabetically.</p>"
  },
  "middle": {
    "@type": "<HTML>",
    "value": "<p>Renders third.</p>"
  },
  "route": "ordered-children",
  "zeta": {
    "@type": "<HTML>",
    "value": "<p>Renders first by source order.</p>"
  }
}
==== expected output ====
<!DOCTYPE html><html><body><p>Renders first by source order.</p><p>Renders second, not first alphabetically.</p><p>Renders third.</p></body></html>
